256
00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:56.620
Lennart Meri ise filmimees armastas
elada nagu filmis.

257
00:15:57.070 --> 00:16:00.000
Ta tegi vingerpusse,
pidas kõnekaid pause

258
00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:02.630
